<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-br">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Temporal Series | Monitoramento</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Zen+Dots&display=swap");

      :root {
        --bg: #08111f;
        --panel: rgba(16, 27, 43, .72);
        --line: rgba(151, 164, 184, .18);
        --muted: #91a0b8;
        --text: #f7fbff;
        --teal: #2dd4bf;
        --blue: #60a5fa;
        --green: #22c55e;
        --amber: #f59e0b;
        --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, .24);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(45, 212, 191, .11), transparent 28%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%, rgba(96, 165, 250, .12), transparent 24%),
          linear-gradient(140deg, #08111f 0%, #0b1626 55%, #0a1020 100%);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
        min-height: 72px;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        background: rgba(8, 17, 31, .82);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        min-width: 0;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 38px;
        height: 38px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--blue));
        color: #06111f;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .logo {
        font-family: "Zen Dots", Inter, sans-serif;
        font-size: 18px;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .subtitle {
        margin-top: 3px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .nav a,
      .ghost-btn,
      .primary-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 38px;
        padding: 0 13px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--text);
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, transform .18s ease;
      }

      .nav a,
      .ghost-btn {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
        border: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .nav a:hover,
      .ghost-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
        border-color: var(--line);
      }

      .nav .active {
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, .12);
        border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, .35);
        color: #bffaf2;
      }

      .primary-btn {
        min-height: 44px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--blue));
        color: #06111f;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .primary-btn:hover,
      .ghost-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .page {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .hero {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(340px, 460px);
        gap: 58px;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
        padding: 70px 0 54px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        animation: fadeUp .7s ease both;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #bffaf2;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .status-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(34, 197, 94, .9);
        animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        max-width: 680px;
        font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 74px);
        line-height: .98;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      .hero h1 span {
        color: #a7f3d0;
      }

      .hero p {
        max-width: 610px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }

      .signal-card {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 420px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background:
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 27, 43, .86), rgba(8, 17, 31, .86)),
          repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(151, 164, 184, .055) 0 1px, transparent 1px 44px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        animation: fadeUp .7s ease .12s both;
      }

      .signal-card::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 0%, rgba(45, 212, 191, .1) 44%, transparent 62%);
        transform: translateX(-120%);
        animation: scan 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      .signal-header {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 18px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .signal-title {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .signal-status {
        color: #bbf7d0;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .signal-body {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        padding: 24px 20px 20px;
      }

      .signal-chart {
        width: 100%;
        height: 176px;
      }

      .signal-chart .grid-line {
        stroke: rgba(151, 164, 184, .15);
        stroke-width: 1;
      }

      .signal-chart .threshold {
        stroke: var(--amber);
        stroke-width: 2;
        stroke-dasharray: 8 8;
      }

      .signal-chart .line {
        fill: none;
        stroke: var(--teal);
        stroke-width: 4;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
        stroke-dasharray: 640;
        stroke-dashoffset: 640;
        animation: drawLine 2s ease .35s forwards;
      }

      .signal-chart .glow {
        fill: none;
        stroke: rgba(45, 212, 191, .18);
        stroke-width: 12;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
        stroke-dasharray: 640;
        stroke-dashoffset: 640;
        animation: drawLine 2s ease .35s forwards;
      }

      .signal-meta {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .metric {
        min-height: 82px;
        padding: 13px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(151, 164, 184, .14);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(5, 12, 23, .42);
      }

      .metric span {
        display: block;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .metric strong {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 0 0 72px;
      }

      .feature-card {
        min-height: 164px;
        padding: 18px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--panel);
        transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
        animation: fadeUp .7s ease both;
      }

      .feature-card:nth-child(2) {
        animation-delay: .08s;
      }

      .feature-card:nth-child(3) {
        animation-delay: .16s;
      }

      .feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, .36);
        background: rgba(20, 34, 54, .82);
      }

      .feature-card small {
        color: var(--teal);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        margin: 16px 0 10px;
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      @keyframes fadeUp {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
          transform: translateY(18px);
        }

        to {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: translateY(0);
        }
      }

      @keyframes pulse {
        0%, 100% {
          opacity: .65;
          transform: scale(1);
        }

        50% {
          opacity: 1;
          transform: scale(1.35);
        }
      }

      @keyframes drawLine {
        to {
          stroke-dashoffset: 0;
        }
      }

      @keyframes scan {
        0%, 38% {
          transform: translateX(-120%);
        }

        72%, 100% {
          transform: translateX(120%);
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *,
        *::after {
          animation-duration: .001ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .topbar {
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
          padding: 14px 18px;
        }

        .nav {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .hero {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          min-height: auto;
          padding: 44px 0;
        }

        .feature-grid,
        .signal-meta {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .page {
          width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px);
        }

        .signal-card {
          min-height: auto;
        }

        .signal-chart {
          height: 138px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <div class="brand-mark">TS</div>
        <div>
          <div class="logo">Temporal Series</div>
          <div class="subtitle">Monitoramento Prometheus</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navegacao principal">
        <a class="active" href="/">Inicio</a>
        <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <a href="/register">Registro</a>
        <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="page">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> Coleta e alertas em tempo real</div>
          <h1>Monitoramento de <span>series temporais</span>.</h1>
          <p>Centralize métricas prometheus em dashboards objetivos, visualizando o desempenho em tempo real. receba alertas automáticos, e obtenha insights valiosos sobre o comportamento do seu sistema.</p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="primary-btn" href="/register">Criar conta</a>
            <a class="ghost-btn" href="/dashboard">Ver dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="signal-card" aria-label="Previa animada de serie temporal">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <div class="signal-title">node_cpu_seconds_total</div>
            <div class="signal-status">ONLINE</div>
          </div>

          <div class="signal-body">
            <svg class="signal-chart" viewBox="0 0 420 176" role="img" aria-label="Grafico animado de uso de CPU">
              <line class="grid-line" x1="0" y1="36" x2="420" y2="36"></line>
              <line class="grid-line" x1="0" y1="88" x2="420" y2="88"></line>
              <line class="grid-line" x1="0" y1="140" x2="420" y2="140"></line>
              <line class="threshold" x1="0" y1="54" x2="420" y2="54"></line>
              <polyline class="glow" points="0,132 40,124 80,138 120,96 160,110 200,70 240,84 280,46 320,68 360,50 420,62"></polyline>
              <polyline class="line" points="0,132 40,124 80,138 120,96 160,110 200,70 240,84 280,46 320,68 360,50 420,62"></polyline>
            </svg>

            <div class="signal-meta">
              <div class="metric">
                <span>CPU</span>
                <strong>42%</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span>Threshold</span>
                <strong>80%</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span>Status</span>
                <strong>OK</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="Recursos do projeto">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <small>01</small>
          <h3>Dashboards por metrica</h3>
          <p>Adicione cards de metricas conforme a necessidade da analise.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <small>02</small>
          <h3>Thresholds configuraveis</h3>
          <p>Defina limites e acompanhe o estado do alerta direto no grafico e na lista lateral.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <small>03</small>
          <h3>Historico de eventos</h3>
          <p>Consulte registros de warning e critical para entender quando uma serie saiu do comportamento esperado.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
